<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: '60px 60px',
    flexDirection: 'column',
    fontFamily: '"Arial", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>
        STEP 7 / 7 · WHAT A NEGATIVE RESULT BUYS
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia, serif', fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.18, marginTop: 12 }}>
        A negative result, and what it buys
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 20 }}>
        We did not beat the closing market. What we bought is three things that a positive result would not have produced.
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, marginTop: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '16px 18px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>BUYS 01</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 7, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                A price map that carries its method
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 6 }}>
                Three de-vigging methods side by side, the most deviant one pre-registered as a secondary claim.
                A reader who de-vigs differently can recompute instead of trusting us.
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '16px 18px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>BUYS 02</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 7, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                An answer located by kind of match
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 6 }}>
                Promotion widens the gap, early rounds narrow it. The pair says more than “the model is worse
                somewhere”, and it includes the half we got wrong.
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '16px 18px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>BUYS 03</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 7, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                Two literatures joined up
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 6 }}>
                Market accuracy and model accuracy on the same 16,728 matches, one margin, one resampling —
                which only works because of the H4 step.
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 18, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        Limits: one sport, six leagues; closing prices from one bookmaker; 48 blocks resolve nothing finer
        than 0.02 nats.
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '12px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230' }}>
            One command rebuilds every number on these slides:
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 0.4 }}>
            python -m src.eval.run_m2
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', marginTop: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia, serif', fontSize: 28, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
            Thank you
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>
            Team 32 · 24 November 2026
        </Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
